---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Capabilities" description="EV charging, utility substructure, energy storage and civil, self-performed under one contract." path="/capabilities/">
<section id="capabilities"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Specialties</p>
    <h1>What we build.</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="caps">
    <div class="cap"><h3>EV charging infrastructure</h3><p>Tesla V3/V4 cabinets and Megachargers, DCFC dispensers and power units, fleet and heavy-duty truck charging.</p></div>
    <div class="cap"><h3>Utility substructure</h3><p>Duct banks, vaults, PME pads and switchgear placement, including ROW and POI corridors.</p></div>
    <div class="cap"><h3>Energy storage</h3><p>Turnkey BESS: excavation, underground, concrete pads, Megapack and Powerpack sets, conduit and wire.</p></div>
    <div class="cap"><h3>Civil</h3><p>Trenching, directional boring, public right-of-way work, pads, asphalt, curb and gutter, ADA and restoration.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="utilities">
    <div>
      <p class="label">Utility experience in California</p>
      <ul><li>SCE</li><li>SDG&amp;E</li><li>PG&amp;E</li><li>LADWP</li><li>Burbank Water &amp; Power</li><li>SMUD</li></ul>
    </div>
    <p>We manage utility coordination, inspections and tie-in readiness on complicated right-of-way and point-of-interconnect work: duct banks, vaults and PME and switchgear pads on active corridors.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <p class="label">Self-perform and capacity</p>
    <h2>Our crews. Our equipment. One contract.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="two">
    <div class="point"><h3>Single-source, self-performed</h3><p>C-10 and Class A under one contract: excavation, conduit, prefabrication, install and energization. No coordination gap between trades.</p></div>
    <div class="point"><h3>Company-owned equipment</h3><p>In-house trenching, concrete, conduit and wire crews on owned equipment, so schedule and quality stay under one roof.</p></div>
    <div class="point"><h3>Workforce capacity</h3><p>Field crews are ours, not brokered. We staff multi-site programs at the same time and move crews between sites without renegotiating scope.</p></div>
    <div class="point"><h3>Prevailing wage, handled</h3><p>DIR-registered with certified payroll and correct trade classifications, including Cement Mason on pads. Open shop with full public works compliance.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
<div class="ctaband"><div class="wrap">
  <h2>Have a plan set? We'll price it.</h2>
  <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Request a bid</a>
</div></div>
</Base>
